<http://digistrucmed.org/page/43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_p0051> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Page> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0031/tu_0007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aliskiren\nRenin inhibitor\nD\nUnknown\nYes (secreted in rat milk)\nNo use in first trimester; contraindicated in second and third trimesters\n• see other RAAS blockers\nAnimal data:\n• no evidence of embryofoetal toxicity or teratogenicity at doses ≤600 mg/kg/day in rats or 100 mg/kg/day in rabbits\n• fertility, pre-natal development, and post-natal development were unaffected in rats at doses ≤250 mg/kg/day. The doses in rats and rabbits provided systemic exposures of 1–4× and 5× MRHD" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Acenocoumarol> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/SurfaceForm> .
